      "title": "bthci_evt: Add vendor-specific subevent dissector table",
      "message": "bthci_evt: Add vendor-specific subevent dissector table\n\nPreviously, the vendor-spefic events are sent to be dissected based on the chip\nvendor. But there are some types of events that needs to be considered by\nsubevent code instead. One prime example is Android's various hci events\n(https://source.android.com/docs/core/connect/bluetooth/hci_requirements),\nwhere the dissection should be tied so the subevent instead of the chip vendor.\n\nWith this change we try to dissect based on subevents first, then if there are\nno matching dessectors we fall back to the previous logic of chip vendor.\nIt should make both public and private dissectors development easier.\n",
      "author_name": "Poompatai Puntitpong",
      "author_email": "poompatai@google.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-09-09T17:01:17.000+08:00",
